    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Covert Ops Cell</strong></p><p><strong>“If you saw it happen, it wasn’t us.”</strong></p><p>Covert Ops cells make wars quiet. They prefer locks to speeches, shadows to banners, and results to credit. They don’t start fights—they rearrange the board so the fight never happens.</p><p><em>You are now a system inside the system. People feel you before they see you.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You can move at a normal pace while traveling stealthily and reroll the lowest die on checks made to create or bypass security systems.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> —</li></ul>",
